{
	title: '/account moves the session to the next login',
	spec: "/account moves the session to the next login of its model's provider (anthropic or openai), in /status order, wrapping; repeated before a request it keeps advancing. The pick (auth.state.picked, in memory per session) takes effect from the next request and outranks usage ranking and API-key ordering. It is a move, not a pin: once the account is rate limited for the model or its login is broken, rotation moves on as usual and the pick is forgotten. Other providers' models get an error naming the model. Requested by the user: manual account switching, as simple as account number + 1.",
